      "id": 431,
      "name": "Bane Shift",
      "description": "For 6 turns, this champion is <mechanic value=cleansed>Cleansed</mechanic> at the start of each turn. For every condition removed this way, a random enemy champion within 5 spaces loses 5 HP. This effect is hidden until triggered.",
      "flavorText": "\"Goblins are idiots, they harm themselves and everyone around them in every conceivable way and it ends up being hilarious to them regardless of the outcome.\" - Anonymous",
