      "name": "Banish",
      "description": "Target enemy champion without <ability value=680>Planar Bound</ability> and any equipment on it are returned to their owner's rune dock with a two turn cooldown. At the start of the owner's next turn, the player gains nora equal to 75% of the costs of the runes. The nora refund is unaffected by reducing effects.",
      "flavorText": "\"Don't think of this as 'goodbye'. Think of it as an introduction to true suffering.\" Xuvali, Deep Elf Temptress",
