      "description": "Enemy champions become <condition value=defiled>Defiled</condition> for 12 turns.",
      "flavorText": "\"Your people are not safe, Rugolth. Do you think stone can thwart me? Ha! You are foolish, dwarf. Your stronghold will crumble, and your subjects will decay. You cannot escape my grasp!\" - Maxxarek of Sheoul\r\n",
