      "description": "Target friendly unit becomes <condition value=stealthed>Stealthed</condition> and gains <ability value=13>Detection 3</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "Serkan has many eyes, in many different places. With these eyes, Serkan can see everything. The eyes see, but cannot be seen. They are always watching.",
