      "name": "Blessing of Al'Mara",
      "description": "Target champion gains <ability value=1>Flight</ability>; if target champion has Class: Paladin or Priest, it also gains <ability value=1395>Hunter: Walker</ability> and Race: Angel.",
      "flavorText": "Remnir was flying. He didn't remember how or why, but he made the best of it anyway. As he passed a mountain, he saw an angel standing at its peak. She smiled and waved to him.",
