      "name": "Blinding Reflection",
      "description": "Target non-Illusion, non-Hero friendly champion loses all conditions and is removed from play. It then re-enters play along with 3 Illusion champions that appear to be identical copies of this champion. When this champion leaves play, the Illusions are destroyed.",
      "flavorText": "\"He said there were twenty of them. Well, twenty combatants don't leave one set of tracks.\" - Ceyana, Deep Elf Mercenary",
