      "description": "Target champion is removed from play. At the end of 2 turns, the champion is returned to play in the location where it was removed from play. If that location is occupied, that unit loses 5 hp and the redeployment effect is delayed for 1 turn (this process repeats until the unit is successfully redeployed).",
      "flavorText": "\"Day 2. The Alpha has seen my steps along the trail. I've spent time hiding in the brush. He has been pacing the perimeter the whole time, but I see him losing interest. He'll give up soon.\" - Vahkosh, Headhunter",
