    {
      "id": 112,
      "name": "Consecrate the Earth",
      "description": "Area Effect 3:  Friendly Priests, Shamans, and Paladins are cleansed and healed for 5 HP, and terrain modifications are removed from this space.  For 4 turns, affected spaces become <mechanic value=hallowed_ground>Hallowed Ground</mechanic>. For each friendly champion with Class: Paladin or Class: Priest in play, this spell is refunded 3 nora to a maximum of 15.\n",
      "flavorText": "\"Is there any way you can amplify the effects of that spell...it'd be nice not to worry about the dead any longer.\" - Rugolth, Dwarven King",
      "noraCost": 30,
      "artist": "Bryan Rypkowski",
      "factions": [
