      "description": "Target enemy champion takes 9 Sonic damage.  The next closest enemy champion within 3 spaces takes 12 Sonic damage, and the next closest enemy champion within 3 spaces of the second champion takes 15 Sonic damage and gains Immunity - Sonic.  Each champion may only be affected once by each instance of this spell.",
      "flavorText": "Originally developed by the Cyclops of the Old Kingdom as a weapon against the Voil, the Wailing Chimes were thought destroyed after the Voil came to power.",
