      "name": "Cull the Weak",
      "description": "Target champion loses 8 HP.  If this destroys the champion, a Phylactery relic is summoned in the closest friendly deployment zone.",
      "flavorText": "Sometimes, to carry back a message, the undead let a single enemy live. Sometimes, they don't -- that's the message. ",
