      "description": "Area Effect 3: For each vegetation space in the affected area, that space becomes dirt and you receive 1 nora. Enemy champions  occupying those spaces lose 2 AP and become <condition value=burred>Burred</condition> for 4 turns.",
      "flavorText": "\"You're too young to remember, but in the days before the Catastrophe we used to have five growing seasons.\" - Verlek, Elven Bard",
