      "flavorText": "\"At night, Gharivol is filled with the smell of incense. They burn it at the port, in front of the altar to Eriluun. There is a Favored there, who prays to her through the night.\" - H'aliel, priest of K'thir",
      "noraCost": 30,
      "artist": "James Ryman",
      "factions": [
        "K'thir Forest"
      ],
      "rarity": "UNCOMMON",
      "cooldown": 6,
