      "name": "Evolve",
      "description": "Area Effect 3: Affected Aquatic champions lose Aquatic, and gain +2 SPD, +3 DMG and <ability value=2>Amphibious</ability> for 5 turns.",
      "flavorText": "\"Did that fish just talk?\" - Ceyana, Deep Elf Mercenary",
