      "name": "Festering Wounds",
      "description": "Damaged enemy champions become <condition value=diseased>Diseased</condition> and <condition value=inhibited>Inhibited</condition> for 4 turns.",
      "flavorText": "\"The sight of blood is so much more satisfying when accompanied with a twinge of mortified flesh.\" - Xulos, Apprentice to Serkan",
