      "name": "Fiery Ambush",
      "description": "At the beginning of next turn, all spaces of the font deployment zone become a Fire Wall (Whenever an enemy champion enters this space, it takes 5 Fire damage and becomes Charred 4) for 1 turn.",
      "flavorText": "\"The only thing better than burning someone is watching them burn themselves.\" ~ Goblin Arsonist",
