      "description": "Area Effect 2: Units in the affected area take 11 Fire damage.  Champions successfully damaged become <condition value=charred>Charred</condition> for 2 turns.\n",
      "flavorText": "\"Fire was meant to burn things, especially elves, it is our greatest ally!\" - Maxxarek of Sheoul",
