      "description": "Area Effect 2:  A Groble with 25% HP is summoned at target location.  If there is a champion on the targeted space, that unit takes 12 physical damage and is knocked back 1 square prior to the deployment of the Groble.  All other champions in the affected area take 8 physical damage. ",
      "flavorText": "\"Have you ever thought about slingin' them? They seem sturdy enough.\" -  Hyron Redtail, credited inventor of the Groble Bombardment",
