    {
      "id": 61,
      "name": "Haunt",
      "description": "Target relic gains <ability value=757>Immobile</ability> and <ability value=2260>Pariah</ability>. Spaces within 4 spaces of it becomes Dead Magic Zone for 5 turns. When this effect ends, 3x Shades with 0 nora cost and no upgrades are summoned in the affected area, and the relic is destroyed.",
      "flavorText": "\"Ghosts are greedier in death than they ever were in life. Best not to tamper with what they claim.\" Menalaus, Priest of K'thir",
