      "name": "Memento",
      "description": "All friendly champions with 3 base DEF gain +1 DEF permanently.  If a champion has 2 or less base DEF, it gains +2 DEF instead. This effect does not stack.",
      "flavorText": "\"I took his armor, so the Stitched wouldn't get it. I knew that it was better I take it than to have it sewed into a Blackguard. It didn't help with the guilt\" - K'oras, Elven Fury",
