      "flavorText": "\"Priestess Yorin touched the creatures face and then brought her hand to its chest. The monster began to jerk and spring back to life. We retreated before it fully regained its senses. I asked her why she revived the foul demon and she gave no reply.\" - Thomroy, Priest of Ironfist",
      "noraCost": 20,
