      "name": "Mindstorm",
      "description": "Target champion takes 10 Psychic damage, loses all AP and becomes <condition value=shocked>Shocked 3</condition>.",
      "flavorText": "\"Selea and I stood there at the edge of the cavern staring across at a large encampment of Nefari warriors, we had found our quarry, when all of sudden she fell to the floor, screaming and convulsing. I knew it was time to go.\" - Fehra, Wild Elf Scout",
