      "name": "Rally the Herd",
      "description": "The next time each Centaur champion you own makes a basic attack this turn, they each make a second attack against the same target for free.",
      "flavorText": "\"Draw your swords and raise your shields. Archers, ready your bows. We take the fight to their front line. They fight centaurs today; and they will never forget.\" - Aririn, Centaur Commander",
      "noraCost": 55,
      "artist": "James Ryman",
