      "name": "Razor Ice",
      "description": "Area Effect 3: Friendly champions gain Rend 1 and Attack: Physical for 6 turns.  If the champion has a Frost basic attack, it also gains 1 AP.",
      "flavorText": "\"Sharpen the Nora, as it flows through you, and it will sharpen any weapon you wield. Take this lesson with you, L`evia, teach it to your Shardmasters.\" - K`ento, Jakei Disciple",
