    {
      "id": 245,
      "name": "Rebound",
      "description": "Area Effect 3: All equipment on champions in the area is destroyed. Enemy champions affected by this gain <ability value=2093>Ponderous</ability> for 2 turns.",
      "flavorText": "\"And if you lose your weapon in battle, what will you do? I am trying to teach you to fight without steel! Must I take your dagger away, before you take my teaching to heart?\" - K`ento, Jakei Disciple",
