      "name": "Reckless Command",
      "description": "Your opponent's champions take 1 damage for each rune they currently have on cooldown.",
      "flavorText": "The Voil advised that a direct assault on Forglar would certainly result in tremendous losses. After several failed attempts, the G`hern agreed.",
      "noraCost": 35,
      "artist": "Bryan Rypkowski",
