      "deckLimit": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 362,
      "name": "Reckless Summoning",
      "description": "The next time your opponent attempts to deploy a champion from the rune dock, its nora cost is refunded and goes on cooldown for 4 turns and a Reckless Spellhack under your control with no upgrades is deployed in the closest friendly deployment zone. This effect is hidden until triggered.",
      "flavorText": "\"We were expectin' Cpt. Shellhorn on deck and this little bugger popped up in his place. I tell you, Admiral, the whole bloody island's gone mad!\" - Virgel Ironhide, crewtort of the Ellie P.",
      "noraCost": 35,
