      "id": 282,
      "name": "Reclaim",
      "description": "Area Effect 3: This area becomes Vegetation.  At the end of your turns, all enemy champions within the area are <condition value=pacified>Pacified</condition> for its next turn, and the area of this spell's effect decreases by 1. ",
      "flavorText": "\"Now that we have pushed the Draksar out, K`thir will heal. It will take time, but eventually the land will be green and lush. K`thir will be healthy again.\" - Menalaus, Priest of K`thir",
      "noraCost": 50,
