      "description": "Target champion takes 15 Sonic damage. If target champion takes damage, the next closest champion within 4 squares takes 5 Sonic damage and is <condition value=paralyzed>Paralyzed</condition> for 2 turns if it takes damage.",
      "flavorText": "To the younger Jangar, spellcasting became a contest of skill. Apprentices would compete to perform spells based on style and finesse. Some of these, like the reverberating blast, became commonly practiced styles. ",
      "noraCost": 50,
      "artist": "Slawomir Maniak",
      "factions": [
        "Forglar Swamp"
      ],
