      "description": "For 6 turns, when target friendly champion takes damage from an attack, opposing non-Avatar champions within 5 spaces become <condition value=cursed>Cursed</condition> for 5 turns and take 50% of the damage as Magic damage. If the target was already Cursed, then this will deal an additional 5 damage. This effect does not stack and is hidden until triggered.",
      "flavorText": "\"Ash to ash.\" - Sumjen, Soul Siren",
      "noraCost": 30,
