      "name": "Rock Torrent",
      "description": "Target a friendly champion occupying Rock. Opposing champions within 5 spaces of target take 10 Physical damage and spaces adjacent to them becomes Unstable Ground for 2 turns.",
      "flavorText": "\"Let the rage of the land consume you fully, then your foes shall know the true extent of her power.\"\r\n~ Geomancer Rivanka",
