      "description": "The next time an opposing relic is deployed within 8 turns, it is destroyed and all enemy champions within 3 spaces of it take 9 Physical damage and are knocked back 2 spaces. This effect is hidden until triggered. This effect does not stack.",
      "flavorText": "\"Don't worry about the Obelisk, M`alta. I think you'll enjoy the modifications I've made to it. I can't say the same of the Deep-elves.\" - K`elim, Elven Ranger",
