      "name": "Sandstorm",
      "description": "Area Effect 4: Units within the affected area take 7 Physical damage and champions successfully damaged become <condition value=sandblasted>Sandblasted</condition> for 3 turns. Affected spaces become Sand for 6 turns.",
      "flavorText": "\"The relentless grains had taken the skin from our faces and the edge from our blades. I was amazed they had not also taken our sight.\" - Dalain, Dwarven Fieldscribe",
