      "description": "Target enemy champion takes 5 Magical damage for each champion with Class: Paladin or Class: Priest within 5 spaces of it, to a max of 25. If the target is killed by this spell, enemy champions within 3 spaces of the champion become <condition value=awestruck>Awestruck</condition>.",
