      "description": "Target champion is <condition value=defiled>Defiled</condition> and takes 3 Fire damage at the end of each turn for 6 turns.  If this effect leaves play before the champion is destroyed, you gain 30 nora.",
      "flavorText": "\"Fire burns fast and hard, but long after the rage of the flames have died down, the ashes remain filled with potential energy.  It is from these ashes that we craft our magic.\" ~ Ptoric, Ash Demon",
