      "description": "Area Effect 3: At the start of your next turn, enemy units take 8 Frost damage, become Grounded (This unit loses Flying) and Frozen (This unit has -1 DMG, -1 DEF and -1 SPD) for 6 turns, and affected spaces becomes Deep Snow (Impeding 2) for 6 turns. This effect is hidden until triggered.",
      "flavorText": "\"Asistil, before you go you should be wary of their land itself. If the Tundra slips away, so shall you slip into the forbidden caverns.\" - Surah, Nefari Forlorn",
