      "name": "Snowstorm",
      "description": "Area Effect 4: For the next 6 turns, within the affected spaces, all dirt terrain becomes Snow (Impeding 1), all water terrain becomes ice. All units take 8 Frost damage.",
      "flavorText": "\"Keep your wits about you soldiers...snow is unnatural for this time of year...the Frost ones are near.\" - Draksar Commander",
