      "description": "Destroy target Stitched champion you own.  The closest opposing champion gains Stitched Possessed (At the beginning of each turn, this champion deals 6 Psychic damage to the friendly champion with greatest HP within 6 spaces) and Depression (All champions within 3 spaces of this unit have -2 DMG).",
