      "description": "At the beginning of your next turn, all units within 2 spaces of target space takes 15 Fire damage and all affected spaces becomes Shallow Lava for 4 turns. This effect is hidden until triggered.",
      "flavorText": "\"We were told the volcano on Maljara was dormant, that it had been for centuries. As the Furies advanced up the Crown of Kiergana, the ground began to shiver. Before they reached the summit, the peak was ablaze.\" - H'aliel, Priest of K'thir",
