    {
      "id": 120,
      "name": "Bloodthirsty Blade",
      "description": "This champion gains <ability value=15>Multiattack 1</ability> (This champion's AP cost for making a basic attack is reduced by 1, to a minimum of 2 AP), <ability value=655>Skirmisher</ability> (This unit can only attack champions and transfigured Avatars), <ability value=876>Short-Lived 2</ability> (This unit is Sacrificed after 8 turns), and is <condition value=impervious>Impervious</condition>.",
      "flavorText": "When Vindrax heard of the Kanen in Maljara, he had a weapon forged from his scales. It was said that this blade gave its wielder an endless thirst for blood.",
