    {
      "id": 141,
      "name": "Bracelet of Mirrors",
      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=295>Deflect.</ability> If it has Class: Witch, it also gains <ability value=738>Shielded</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "When Sarinda was finally vanquished, she left many things behind: an army of Stitched, various tomes, enchanted trinkets. One such item was the Bracelet of Mirrors; a bangle that could make one person seem like a hundred.",
