      "description": "Equipped Race: Centaur champion gains <ability value=1962>Weaken Spells</ability> (Friendly champions within 5 spaces take 5 less damage from spells) and <ability value=3319>Spell Breach</ability>. The next non-champion rune played by your opponent from the runedock costs 10 more nora.",
