      "name": "Cloak of Ice",
      "description": "Equipped champion has <ability value=1864>Slowing Armor</ability> and <ability value=1385>Freezing Aura</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "When Argol was appointed Shardseer, he fashioned a cloak of ice to commemorate the occasion. This cloak became a symbol of the Shardseers; a masterpiece of the highest order, shaped from the ice of the tundra.",
