    {
      "id": 113,
      "name": "Cloak of Long Knives",
      "description": "Equipped champion with Class: Rogue or Ranger has +2 DMG and gains <ability value=1790>Shadow Shift</ability>. If the equipped unit has range 2 or less it gains <ability value=2357>Shadowstrike</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "\"The shadows accepted the young elf. If she could take a blade to her love, then she was little more than a shadow. She was given a cloak, marked with her crest: the Long Knife.\" - Tale of the Long Knife",
