      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=1571>Nature's Blessing 1</ability> and has +1 DMG for each K'thir Forest champion you have on cooldown (to a maximum of 6). If there are 4 or more champions on cooldown, this unit also gets +1 DEF. When equipped champion is destroyed, this equipment is equipped onto the closest valid friendly champion.",
