      "flavorText": "The Dunewalkers endured endless hardship after their exile from Valdac. With each passing day, they grew accustomed to the harsh Dunes. Soon, their environment became their advantage against invaders. With the help of their leader, Derifos, the Dunewalkers prospered in the desert.",
