      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=326>Phase Shift</ability> and <ability value=3013>Soultap Feedback</ability>. This equipment can be dropped as a relic with <ability value=1821>Ghost Pendant</ability> and <ability value=1827>Wieldable</ability>.",
