    {
      "id": 128,
      "name": "Goading Mask",
      "description": "Equipped champion has <ability value=1269>Antagonize</ability>. If it has Race: Boghopper,  it also gains <ability value=966>Cackle</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "The Mongrel slipped the mask over his face and was set upon by his pack, the frenzied Kanen swiping and biting at him. When the mask came off, another Mongrel picked it up and placed it on his face. Nine unconscious Kanen later, the remaining pack decided the mask was evil.",
