    {
      "id": 159,
      "name": "Heart of Gnash",
      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=543>Attack: Fire</ability> and <ability value=539>Attack: Acid</ability>. If it already has Attack: Fire or Attack: Acid, it also gains <ability value=910>Amplify: Fire</ability> and <ability value=2497>Amplify: Acid</ability>.",
