      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=3130>Karmic Reward</ability> (The first time each turn this champion activates a non-basic attack ability, it is healed for 6 HP.  If that ability targets a friendly champion, this champion also gains 2 MAX HP.) and <ability value=2559>Commander</ability> (Friendly champions within 5 spaces that share a race or class with this champion have +2 DMG. This does not stack with other Commanders.).",
      "flavorText": "Honor Coins are not currency, but a symbol of dedication and respect.  Obtaining one from high ranking members of the Throne is considered to be an especially great honor.",
