      "name": "Hunter's Charm",
      "description": "Equipped champion has <ability value=1842>Trail: Vegetation</ability> and <ability value=1327>Domain: Vegetation</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "The Wilderkin believed themselves to be the greatest predators of K`thir. Some even dared to hunt rangers of K`thir. To protect themselves, the Rangers appointed a few to counter the Wilderkin advances. They were known simply as the Hunters, marked by a wooden charm around their necks.",
