      "description": "Equipped champion is <condition value=distracted>Distracted</condition>.",
      "flavorText": "\"Be careful in the jungles, friend. Even the plants will... try to... That's a lovely one, right there. This place is so beautiful. I think I might settle here, some day.\" - F'aridan, Elven Archer",
