    {
      "id": 183,
      "name": "Shredding Bracelet",
      "description": "Equipped champion is <condition value=bloodied>Bloodied</condition>.  At the start of its turn, it loses 3 HP and a Blood Ball worth 8 HP is created on an adjacent space.",
      "flavorText": "\"Shackles come in many forms. Some bind physically while others are psychological.  These ones are special. They mark you and then slowly drain you of all will to live.  Fascinating, really.\" ~ Lord Rangal",
      "noraCost": 30,
      "artist": "Paul Guzenko",
      "factions": [
