    {
      "id": 147,
      "name": "Skystorm Spear",
      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=3128>Portal Dancer</ability> and <ability value=1264>Swap 3</ability>. If it has Class: Knight, it also gains <ability value=2291>Lightning Storm 3</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "Many myths surround the Skystorm Spear, but they all share one common thread: the spear was thrown from the sky by a god. Ospryans believe the spear was meant as a gift for the Silver General.",
      "noraCost": 30,
      "artist": "Andrew Hou",
      "factions": [
        "K'thir Forest",
