      "deckLimit": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 186,
      "name": "Special Prize",
      "description": "Equipped champion gains -3 DMG, <ability value=2260>Pariah</ability>, <ability value=1724>Depression</ability> and <ability value=2008>Liability</ability>.  After this champion has made 4 attacks, it also gains <ability value=2001>Defenseless</ability> and this equipment's owner gains 10 nora.",
      "flavorText": "Rodney was enjoying himself immensely. Despite it being his first campaign, he was proud of how much better he looked than the rest of the ranger corps.",
      "noraCost": 25,
