      "description": "Equipped friendly champion has the AP cost of its non-basic attacks lowered by 1 to a minimum of 1. Equipped enemy champions have the AP cost of non-basic attacks increased by 1.",
      "flavorText": "\"You must achieve this balance through understanding one truth; that for every light, there is a darkness. This is true of all things.\" - Malalain, Almsgiver",
