      "name": "Staff of the Solstice",
      "description": "Equipped champion with Class: Priest or Shaman has <ability value=371>Heal Mass 2</ability> and <ability value=1728>Divert</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "At the beginning of a season, the Seers would place ornamental staves in the center of their village. These staves of Solstice were believed to invite benevolent spirits to join them in the coming season.",
