      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=1744>Frost Acolyte</ability> and <ability value=137>Frost Aura 3</ability>. If the champion has <ability value=540>Attack: Frost</ability>, it also gains +1 SPD.",
      "flavorText": "In an often barren and marker-less Tundra, the Jakei must use the crystal clear sky to navigate their sea of white.",
