      "description": "Equipped champion with Class: Witch, Priest or Wizard gains <ability value=1398>Hex 2</ability>, <ability value=695>Curse 2</ability> and <ability value=738>Shielded</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "The doll was made from various materials, some including elven hair and skin. As she held it in her hands, H'aliel felt a darkness closing around her. She dropped the doll to the ground and left it there.",
