      "name": "Stonearm Sash",
      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=1328>Domain: Rock</ability>, <ability value=2571>Rock Front</ability> and <ability value=2527>Rock Defiance</ability>.  If it already has Rock Defiance, it also gains <ability value=1199>Calcify</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "The Stonearm Sash was awarded to winners of the Stonearm Tournament. In this competition, participants are expected to perform feats of amazing strength. It is said that the sash holds a special power of its own.",
