      "description": "Equipped champion with a MAX RNG of 2 or less has +2 DMG and gains <ability value=330>Sunder 2</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "\"The last thing you want when you are completely surrounded by baddies is a dull blade...\" - Dwarven Sergeant",
