      "name": "Swamptouch Amulet",
      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=1494>Escalation</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "The boghoppers of the Darkmarsh had accepted the Forglar's gift. In return, they were given power. To keep this power safe, Lemsu fashioned an amulet from the waters. Those who wore it would receive its blessing.",
      "noraCost": 30,
