      "description": "The first 5 damage dealt to equipped champion each turn is prevented.  This equipment is destroyed after it has prevented 50 damage.",
      "flavorText": "Of the many wonders found in the swamp, there are few as impressive as Swamp Wasp Nectar. The nectar is used by the wasps to coat their nests, making them particularly resilient. Some nests have even been found to have survived the tree they were located in being consumed by flame. ",
