      "name": "Sword of Shadows",
      "description": "When this champion makes an attack, its target is <condition value=shadowtouched>Shadowtouched</condition> for 2 turns. This equipment can be dropped as a relic with <ability value=1820>Sword of Shadows</ability> and <ability value=1827>Wieldable</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "\"In darkness it was forged, of indescribable materials. In darkness, it drank the shadows and sharpened its edge with the blackness.\" - Inscription on the Sword of Shadows",
