      "name": "Tactical Manual",
      "description": "Equipped champion has +1 DMG for every 15 HP it currently has. At the end of its turn, it heals 1 HP with 1 additional HP for every 15 HP it is missing.\r\n",
      "flavorText": "\"This has everything you need to know, if it'??s not in here, then you don't need to know it!\" -Dwarven Sergeant.\r\n",
