      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=839>Explosive Attack 3</ability> and <ability value=3096>Cull</ability>. If it has Race: Tortun, it also permanently loses <ability value=2093>Ponderous.</ability>",
      "flavorText": "\"It be the only one of its kind. He only brings it out when he be lookin' ta kill somethin'. I've seen it punch a hole right through a Tortun shell wit' no trouble 'tall!\" - Mendal Rawtongue of the Rotmaw",
