    {
      "id": 26,
      "name": "Traitorous Helm",
      "description": "Equipped friendly Race: Demon champion gains <ability value=2753>Noble Sacrifice</ability>, <ability value=725>Transfer Life 1</ability>, <ability value=2260>Pariah</ability>, and <ability value=876>Short Lived 2</ability>. When this champion dies, the closest enemy champion within 5 spaces gains <ability value=936>Surge: Demon</ability>, becomes  <condition value=possessed>Possessed</condition> and <condition value=defiled>Defiled</condition> for 3 turns, and gains <ability value=1408>Chasm Walker</ability> for 4 turns.",
      "flavorText": "Maxxarek's discovery of Gibir's deceit inspired an era of distrust within his inner circle.",
