      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=1248>Pull</ability> and  <ability value=163>Rend 1</ability>. This equipment can be dropped as a relic with <ability value=1819>Vicious Harpoon</ability> and <ability value=1827>Wieldable</ability>.",
