    {
      "id": 65,
      "name": "Visage of Ironfist",
      "description": "Equipped champion gains <ability value=1306>Mountaineer</ability> and has +1 DMG for each Ironfist champion you have on cooldown (up to a maximum of 6 champions). If there are 4 or more champions on cooldown, this unit also gets +1 DEF. When equipped champion is destroyed, this equipment is equipped onto the closest valid friendly champion.",
      "flavorText": "\"Many have claimed Ironfist as their home, and many have died for its safety. This helm was crafted to honor their sacrifice and to inspire those who still fight.\" - Janist, Master Armorer\r\n",
      "noraCost": 35,
