      "description": "This relic has Nora Gem (This unit is a Nora Gem. It gains the abilities of any friendly relic with Nora Gem within 5 spaces.) and Defiling Luminescence (When this unit is deployed and at the start of its turns, opposing champions within 4 spaces become Cursed 2 and Defiled 2). ",
      "flavorText": "Lavaburst Spinels are found in caves, many of which are directly connect to Sheoul. To Elsarin, these gems signified the use of dark magic; once a cautionary symbol, now a badge of pride. ",
