    {
      "id": 5,
      "name": "Nora Mine",
      "description": "At the beginning of your turn, you gain 5 additional nora, as well as 1 additional nora for each Nora Miner in play (a Nora Miner is a unit with the Nora Miner ability).",
      "flavorText": "\"Patience your grace, these mines will profit if you only give them time.\" - Feofil, attempt to calm an angry Rugolth ",
