    {
      "id": 22,
      "name": "Nora Pearls",
      "description": "When a player successfully casts a spell, the enemy gains Nora equal to 50% of that spells Nora cost.  This does not stack.  (Unique: Spell Seal - you may only have 2 Spell Seal runes in your Battlegroup)",
      "flavorText": "\"Day 23: Further testing on the pearls concludes that they do react to the presence of channeled Nora. Perhaps this is why the pools glow blue?\" - Journal of Kali, Elven Apprentice Mage",
