      "name": "Northern Cross Obelisk",
      "description": "This relic has Penance (When this unit is damaged, friendly champions within 3 spaces are healed for 50% of the damage (rounded down), and enemy champions within 3 spaces take Magical damage for 50% of the damage (rounded up, ignores DEF)).",
      "flavorText": "The Northern Cross Templars have gained serious ground in recent decades, consolidating power over a large portion of the country-side.  The Inquisition remains in control over most of the more heavily populated areas.",
