      "id": 132,
      "name": "Obelisk of Foresight",
      "description": "This relic has Preordained (This rune is automatically revealed at the beginning of the game), Occlude (This unit loses 3 HP and 3 random runes in your runedock are concealed) and Augury (This unit loses 3 HP and you gain 3 rune reveals).",
      "flavorText": "Within the eye of the storm / Beginning and end collide / Dusk is 'twined with dawn / Till time itself demised - Inscription on the sides of the Obelisk of Foresight",
