      "name": "Orange Myx Pupae",
      "description": "After 5 turns, this relic is destroyed and a Young Myx Drone with no upgrades is summoned in its place.",
      "flavorText": "Myx Pupae are considered a delicacy among the Darkmarsh Boghoppers. They're incredibly hard to get ahold of and even harder to cook correctly since they hatch so fast when threatened. The shells and acid sacs are discarded and tasty tender meat is left. ",
      "noraCost": 25,
      "artist": "Jakub Kasper",
