      "name": "Orb of Frostfall",
      "description": "This relic has <ability value=600>Arctic</ability> and <ability value=2804>Orb of Frostfall 2</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "H'irol looked into the orb, watching frost swirl within its center. He touched its surface and felt a biting chill in his core. As he watched the falling snow, as the wind blew it towards him, he embraced the cold.",
      "noraCost": 25,
      "artist": "Michele Chang",
      "factions": [
