      "name": "Orb of Protection",
      "description": "Friendly Champions receive 20% less damage (after DEF) from spells and ranged attacks while Orb of Protection is in play. This unit loses 3 HP when this effect triggers.  This unit also has Fire Acolyte and Searing Aura 4.",
      "flavorText": "\"Gather beneath my protection, friends. Bask in the warmth of its embers. Let it burn the arrows from your skin. I will protect you from their invocations.\" - Lord Maxxarek of Sheoul",
      "noraCost": 35,
      "artist": "Jakub Kasper",
