      "description": "This relic has Ruby Catalyst (When a unit takes Fire damage, this unit gains +2 MAX HP.  This does not include damage from Charred. When this unit is destroyed, enemy champions within 5 spaces take Fire damage equal this unit's MAX HP, divided evenly (to a minimum of 2 and a maximum of 10)) and Demolish (This unit is Demolished).",
