      "id": 117,
      "name": "Sanctuary of Hope",
      "description": "Friendly champions within 4 spaces of this unit have their AP cost for all abilities (excluding basic attacks) reduced by 1 AP. When a friendly Champion uses an ability (excluding basic attacks) within 4 spaces of this unit, this unit takes 3 Physical damage. This Relic has Consecrated Zone (Area Effect 3: On deploy, friendly Priests, Shamans, and Paladins are cleansed and healed for 5 HP, and terrain modifications are removed from this space. Affected spaces are <mechanic value=hallowed_ground>Hallowed Ground</mechanic>) and Regeneration 1 (At the beginning of your turn, this unit heals 2 HP).",
      "flavorText": "The ancestors of Ironfist made a sanctuary for their king. It took the current residents years to find it. When they did, they shared its shelter. All of Rugolth's subjects enjoyed its serenity.",
