      "deckLimit": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "name": "Soulsphere",
      "description": "All champions you own share damage equally with each other rounded up while this unit is in play (this ignores defense except on the target of an attack).  This unit loses 3 life when a unit you own takes damage.\r\n",
      "flavorText": "\"We share our lives through the Nora. Our souls are conduits, the Nora flowing through each of us as a singular web. An attack against one is an attack against all of us. Remember this lesson.\" - Gekaal, Forglar High One",
