      "id": 162,
      "name": "Soultap Garnet",
      "description": "This relic has Nora Gem (This unit is a Nora Gem. It gains the abilities of any friendly relic with Nora Gem within 5 spaces) and Soultap Luminescence (When this unit is deployed and at the start of its turns, opposing champions within 4 spaces become Soultapped).",
      "flavorText": "Tempest Garnets are found in the particularly turbulent regions of Forglar Swamp. Their namesake comes from the \"tempest\" that rages beneath the gem's surface.",
