      "id": 33,
      "name": "Spirit Altar",
      "description": "While this unit is in play, friendly Forglar Swamp champions gain +5 HP and +1 DMG. This effect does not stack and does not affect teammates in 2v2 games.",
      "flavorText": "\"We do not serve the Swamp, and the Swamp does not serve us. We ARE the Swamp.\"",
