      "description": "While Tainted Statue is in play, all spells cost 35% more nora to cast. This does not stack. (Unique: Spell Seal - you may only have 2 Spell Seal runes in your Battlegroup)",
      "flavorText": "Once celebrating the glory of some forgetten Valdeci general, this statue has been defiled to more closely resemble the Draksar.",
