      "description": "Friendly demons and beasts within 5 spaces of this relic gain <ability value=347>Berserk Attack 2</ability> and <ability value=260>Enrage 2</ability>.",
      "flavorText": "Within the Breath of Sheoul, there is a temple that pays homage to Erimalion. Demons in the Overlands frequent this temple to listen to the tales of Erimalion and his deeds. The tales inspire cruelty in its listener. The very sight of the temple often brings viewers into hysterical rage.",
