      "description": "This relic has The Farm: Beasts (Friendly Beasts gain Opportunistic Assault. This shares a CD with removes the effects of The Farm: Mutants when activated (AP0, CD2)), and The Farm: Mutants (Friendly Mutants gain Pounce. This shares a CD with removes the effects of The Farm: Beasts when activated (AP0, CD2)).",
      "flavorText": "The name may be misleading to outsiders, but the Farm refers not to agriculture, but to the eclectic mix of outcasts and mutants that make up a large part of the Sundered Lands.  For these, representation has been a long time coming.",
      "noraCost": 30,
