      "name": "Throne of the Circle",
      "description": "This relic has <ability value=2022>Throne of the Circle</ability> (Friendly Wizards have Spell Resistance and Magic Nova 3).",
      "flavorText": "The Throne of the Circle was meant as a forum for the Elves of K`thir to discuss the matters facing their home. Over time, only a few voices were allowed to speak and, eventually, these voices became the Circle itself.",
