      "name": "Tortun Land Cannon",
      "description": "This unit has <ability value=2123>Cannon Shot</ability>",
      "flavorText": "\"She's a beauty, isn't she? Had her crafted in Gharivol, I forget the gunsmith's name. She once punched a hole straight through a ship's flank. Beauty and some bite; she's perfect.\" - Captain Tremir Craghide",
