      "id": 188,
      "name": "Tower of Amareth",
      "description": "This relic has Iridescent Projection (When a friendly champion within 8 spaces makes an attack, a random opposing unit within 8 spaces of this one takes 2 Magical damage.  If the attacking champion is a Fairy or a Wizard, the closest unit to this one takes the damage instead.  This damage ignores DEF) and Amplify: Magic (Magic damage dealt to champions and relics is increased by 10%).",
      "flavorText": "\"I don't understand, Menalaus, the towers have laid dormant for years.  What could have awoken them?\" ~ Gregor, Circle Messenger",
      "noraCost": 30,
